  ('audit-group.ai-and-crawler-readiness.ai-content-accessibility','Claritude examines AI content accessibility using 5 technical checks, including main content extractable without JavaScript, main content extractable after JavaScript rendering, login requirement encountered by the audit runner, and related evidence. Clear, machine-readable content and explicit crawler policy help compatible AI systems interpret the page without changing the publisher''s intended access rules.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified AI content accessibility.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with AI content accessibility.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve AI content accessibility, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant AI content accessibility target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about AI content accessibility. {unableReason}','Keep the main content available as readable HTML, avoid login or bot challenges on public pages, and make important text available after rendering.',null,'OpenAI: AI content accessibility','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.ai-and-crawler-readiness.ai-content-structure','Claritude examines AI content structure using 3 technical checks, including main content organised under semantic headings, lists available in machine-readable HTML, tables available in machine-readable HTML. Clear, machine-readable content and explicit crawler policy help compatible AI systems interpret the page without changing the publisher''s intended access rules.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified AI content structure.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with AI content structure.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve AI content structure, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant AI content structure target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about AI content structure. {unableReason}','Organise the main content with semantic headings, lists, and tables where those structures match the content. Do not add markup solely for the audit.',null,'OpenAI: AI content structure','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.ai-and-crawler-readiness.content-attribution-and-identity','Claritude examines content attribution and identity using 8 technical checks, including author attribution declared in structured data, publisher attribution declared in structured data, publication date declared in structured data, and related evidence. Clear, machine-readable content and explicit crawler policy help compatible AI systems interpret the page without changing the publisher''s intended access rules.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified content attribution and identity.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with content attribution and identity.','The audit found an optional or suboptimal content attribution and identity opportunity. This is not a confirmed technical failure.','No relevant content attribution and identity target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about content attribution and identity. {unableReason}','Add accurate author, publisher, date, and identity data where it genuinely describes the page. Link entities with valid URLs and keep visible attribution consistent with structured data.',null,'OpenAI: Content attribution and identity','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.ai-and-crawler-readiness.ai-snippet-restrictions','Claritude examines AI snippet restrictions using 3 technical checks, including nosnippet restrictions detected, max-snippet restrictions detected, data-nosnippet sections detected. Clear, machine-readable content and explicit crawler policy help compatible AI systems interpret the page without changing the publisher''s intended access rules.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified AI snippet restrictions.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with AI snippet restrictions.','The audit recorded the site''s AI snippet restrictions policy. Confirm that this state matches the publisher''s intent; it is not automatically a defect.','No relevant AI snippet restrictions target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about AI snippet restrictions. {unableReason}','Confirm that nosnippet, max-snippet, and data-nosnippet settings match the publisher''s intended reuse policy. Remove a restriction only when broader snippets are genuinely wanted.',null,'OpenAI: AI snippet restrictions','{"kind":"policy","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.ai-and-crawler-readiness.markdown-alternatives','Claritude examines markdown alternatives using 3 technical checks, including linked Markdown alternative for the selected page detected, declared Markdown alternative reachable, declared Markdown alternative contains readable content. Clear, machine-readable content and explicit crawler policy help compatible AI systems interpret the page without changing the publisher''s intended access rules.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified markdown alternatives.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with markdown alternatives.','The audit found an optional or suboptimal markdown alternatives opportunity. This is not a confirmed technical failure.','No relevant markdown alternatives target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about markdown alternatives. {unableReason}','If a Markdown alternative is offered, declare it with a valid URL and ensure the resource returns readable Markdown. Do not add an alternative that will become stale or incomplete.','<link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="/about.md">','llms.txt proposal: Markdown alternatives','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.ai-and-crawler-readiness.llms-full-txt','Claritude examines llms-full.txt using 2 technical checks, including llms-full.txt file reachable, llms-full.txt returned as readable text. Clear, machine-readable content and explicit crawler policy help compatible AI systems interpret the page without changing the publisher''s intended access rules.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified llms-full.txt.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with llms-full.txt.','The audit found an optional or suboptimal llms-full.txt opportunity. This is not a confirmed technical failure.','No relevant llms-full.txt target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about llms-full.txt. {unableReason}','If you choose to publish llms-full.txt, return readable plain text or Markdown at the conventional root URL and keep it current. Its absence is optional and does not require remediation.',null,'llms.txt proposal: llms-full.txt','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.ai-and-crawler-readiness.llms-txt','Claritude examines llms.txt using 7 technical checks, including llms.txt file reachable, llms.txt returned as readable text, llms.txt title detected, and related evidence. Clear, machine-readable content and explicit crawler policy help compatible AI systems interpret the page without changing the publisher''s intended access rules.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified llms.txt.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with llms.txt.','The audit found an optional or suboptimal llms.txt opportunity. This is not a confirmed technical failure.','No relevant llms.txt target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about llms.txt. {unableReason}','If you choose to publish llms.txt, use the proposed Markdown structure, include meaningful links, and keep every declared destination reachable. Its absence is optional and does not require remediation.','# Example Ltd
> A short description of the site.

## Important pages
- [Services](https://example.com/services/)','llms.txt proposal: llms.txt','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.aria-validity','Claritude examines ARIA validity using 9 technical checks, including required ARIA attributes present, ARIA attribute names valid, ARIA attribute values valid, and related evidence. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified ARIA validity.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with ARIA validity.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve ARIA validity, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant ARIA validity target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about ARIA validity. {unableReason}','Correct the listed ARIA roles, attributes, values, parent-child relationships, and duplicate IDs. Prefer native HTML controls before adding ARIA.','<button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-menu">Menu</button>','W3C WAI: ARIA validity','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.button-accessible-names','Claritude examines button accessible names using 2 technical checks, including buttons have accessible names, image buttons have accessible names. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified button accessible names.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with button accessible names.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve button accessible names, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant button accessible names target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about button accessible names. {unableReason}','Give each affected button a concise accessible name using visible text, aria-label, aria-labelledby, or meaningful image alt text.','<button type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu"><svg aria-hidden="true">…</svg></button>','W3C WAI: Button accessible names','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.form-control-labels','Claritude examines form control labels using 5 technical checks, including form inputs have accessible labels, select controls have accessible labels, textareas have accessible labels, and related evidence. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified form control labels.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with form control labels.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve form control labels, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant form control labels target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about form control labels. {unableReason}','Associate every affected form control with one clear label using a label element, aria-label, or aria-labelledby. Keep the label meaningful and visible where possible.','<label for="email">Email address</label>
<input id="email" name="email" type="email">','W3C WAI: Form control labels','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.navigation-control-names','Claritude examines navigation control names using 1 technical check, including primary navigation controls have accessible names. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified navigation control names.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with navigation control names.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve navigation control names, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant navigation control names target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about navigation control names. {unableReason}','Give the affected menu or navigation control a clear accessible name that describes its action, such as Open menu or Close menu.','<button type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu"><svg aria-hidden="true">…</svg></button>','W3C WAI: Navigation control names','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.alt-text-repeats-image-filenames','Claritude examines alt text repeats image filenames using 1 technical check, including alt text repeats image filenames. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified alt text repeats image filenames.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with alt text repeats image filenames.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve alt text repeats image filenames, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant alt text repeats image filenames target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about alt text repeats image filenames. {unableReason}','Replace filename-like alt text with a concise description of the image''s purpose, or use an empty alt attribute when the image is purely decorative.',null,'W3C WAI: Alt text repeats image filenames','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.autoplaying-media','Claritude examines autoplaying media using 1 technical check, including autoplaying media detected. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified autoplaying media.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with autoplaying media.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve autoplaying media, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant autoplaying media target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about autoplaying media. {unableReason}','Disable unexpected autoplay with sound, or provide an immediate pause or stop control. Preserve autoplay only when it is essential and does not obstruct access.',null,'W3C WAI: Autoplaying media','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.iframe-titles','Claritude examines iframe titles using 1 technical check, including iframes have accessible titles. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified iframe titles.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with iframe titles.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve iframe titles, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant iframe titles target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about iframe titles. {unableReason}','Add a short title attribute to each affected iframe so users can identify its purpose before entering it.','<iframe src="/booking" title="Book an appointment"></iframe>','W3C WAI: Iframe titles','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.image-delivery','Claritude examines image delivery using 2 technical checks, including image formats recorded, image transfer sizes measured. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified image delivery.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with image delivery.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve image delivery, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant image delivery target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about image delivery. {unableReason}','Correct each affected image URL and response. Confirm the file exists, returns an image content type, and is accessible without an authentication or bot challenge.',null,'W3C WAI: Image delivery','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.image-loading','Claritude examines image loading using 2 technical checks, including below-the-fold image loading attributes inspected, largest Contentful Paint image uses lazy loading. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified image loading.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with image loading.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve image loading, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant image loading target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about image loading. {unableReason}','Lazy-load suitable below-the-fold images, but keep the hero or likely LCP image eager and discoverable. Use the occurrence viewport data to decide which images qualify.',null,'MDN: Image loading','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.image-resources-fail-to-load','Claritude examines image resources fail to load using 1 technical check, including image resources fail to load. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified image resources fail to load.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with image resources fail to load.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve image resources fail to load, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant image resources fail to load target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about image resources fail to load. {unableReason}','Correct each affected image URL and response. Confirm the file exists, returns an image content type, and is accessible without an authentication or bot challenge.',null,'W3C WAI: Image resources fail to load','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.image-sizing-and-dimensions','Claritude examines image sizing and dimensions using 5 technical checks, including image intrinsic dimensions recorded, image display dimensions recorded, oversized images relative to display dimensions detected, and related evidence. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified image sizing and dimensions.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with image sizing and dimensions.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve image sizing and dimensions, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant image sizing and dimensions target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about image sizing and dimensions. {unableReason}','Set accurate intrinsic width and height, preserve the source aspect ratio, and serve an image close to its rendered size. Update the listed images rather than applying one global dimension.','<img src="/images/team.jpg" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" alt="Our team">','W3C WAI: Image sizing and dimensions','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.images-contain-alt-attributes','Claritude examines images contain alt attributes using 1 technical check, including images contain alt attributes. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified images contain alt attributes.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with images contain alt attributes.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve images contain alt attributes, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant images contain alt attributes target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about images contain alt attributes. {unableReason}','Write meaningful alt text for informative images and use alt="" only for images that are genuinely decorative.','<img src="/images/founder.jpg" alt="Founder speaking at the annual conference">
<img src="/images/divider.svg" alt="">','W3C WAI: Images contain alt attributes','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.images-marked-decorative-remain-focusable','Claritude examines images marked decorative remain focusable using 1 technical check, including images marked decorative remain focusable. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified images marked decorative remain focusable.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with images marked decorative remain focusable.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve images marked decorative remain focusable, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant images marked decorative remain focusable target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about images marked decorative remain focusable. {unableReason}','Remove focusability from decorative images, or provide a meaningful accessible name when the image is interactive.',null,'W3C WAI: Images marked decorative remain focusable','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.responsive-images','Claritude examines responsive images using 2 technical checks, including responsive srcset declarations detected, invalid srcset descriptors detected. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified responsive images.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with responsive images.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve responsive images, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant responsive images target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about responsive images. {unableReason}','Use srcset and sizes when the same image is delivered at materially different display widths. Keep a valid src fallback.','<img src="team-800.jpg" srcset="team-480.jpg 480w, team-800.jpg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 800px" width="800" height="600" alt="Our team">','W3C WAI: Responsive images','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.svg-accessible-names','Claritude examines SVG accessible names using 1 technical check, including SVG elements requiring accessible names have names. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified SVG accessible names.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with SVG accessible names.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve SVG accessible names, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant SVG accessible names target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about SVG accessible names. {unableReason}','Give informative SVG images an accessible name, for example with title and aria-labelledby. Hide purely decorative SVGs from assistive technology.','<svg role="img" aria-labelledby="chart-title">
