  ('audit-group.accessibility.video-captions','Claritude examines video captions using 2 technical checks, including videos contain caption track declarations, caption track resources reachable. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified video captions.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with video captions.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve video captions, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant video captions target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about video captions. {unableReason}','Provide a synchronised captions track for videos containing speech or meaningful audio. Do not label machine-generated captions as final without checking them.','<video controls>
