  ('audit-group.accessibility.keyboard-and-focus','Claritude examines keyboard and focus using 4 technical checks, including focusable elements inside aria-hidden content detected, nested interactive controls detected, positive tabindex values detected, and related evidence. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified keyboard and focus.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with keyboard and focus.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve keyboard and focus, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant keyboard and focus target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about keyboard and focus. {unableReason}','Remove focusable controls from aria-hidden regions, avoid nested interactive elements and positive tabindex values, and make scrollable regions keyboard reachable.',null,'W3C WAI: Keyboard and focus','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
