  ('audit-group.accessibility.meta-refresh','Claritude examines meta refresh using 1 technical check, including meta refresh redirects detected. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified meta refresh.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with meta refresh.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve meta refresh, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant meta refresh target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about meta refresh. {unableReason}','Replace timed meta refresh behaviour with a server redirect or an explicit user action. If a timed refresh is essential, warn users and allow enough time.',null,'W3C WAI: Meta refresh','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.heading-visibility','Claritude examines heading visibility using 1 technical check, including main heading visible at tested widths. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified heading visibility.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with heading visibility.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve heading visibility, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant heading visibility target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about heading visibility. {unableReason}','Ensure the main heading remains visible at the tested viewport and is not clipped, hidden, or replaced with an inaccessible visual treatment.',null,'W3C WAI: Heading visibility','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.mobile-text-sizing','Claritude examines mobile text sizing using 1 technical check, including text sizes measured at tested mobile widths. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified mobile text sizing.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with mobile text sizing.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve mobile text sizing, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant mobile text sizing target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about mobile text sizing. {unableReason}','Increase the affected text to a readable mobile size while preserving zoom and responsive reflow. Check surrounding spacing after the change.',null,'W3C WAI: Mobile text sizing','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.responsive-content-consistency','Claritude examines responsive content consistency using 1 technical check, including desktop and mobile content differences detected. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified responsive content consistency.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with responsive content consistency.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve responsive content consistency, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant responsive content consistency target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about responsive content consistency. {unableReason}','Keep essential content and controls available on both desktop and mobile. Responsive layouts may rearrange content, but should not remove necessary information.',null,'W3C WAI: Responsive content consistency','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.responsive-layout-overflow','Claritude examines responsive layout overflow using 4 technical checks, including horizontal page overflow detected at tested widths, images exceed their containing elements, tables overflow their containing elements, and related evidence. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified responsive layout overflow.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with responsive layout overflow.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve responsive layout overflow, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant responsive layout overflow target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about responsive layout overflow. {unableReason}','Fix the listed overflowing elements with responsive sizing, wrapping, or scroll containers. Avoid globally hiding horizontal overflow because that can conceal content.',null,'W3C WAI: Responsive layout overflow','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.viewport-configuration','Claritude examines viewport configuration using 5 technical checks, including viewport settings restrict zoom, viewport meta tag present, multiple viewport declarations detected, and related evidence. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified viewport configuration.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with viewport configuration.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve viewport configuration, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant viewport configuration target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about viewport configuration. {unableReason}','Use a single responsive viewport declaration with width=device-width and avoid disabling user zoom.','<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">','W3C WAI: Viewport configuration','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.accessibility.accessible-lists','Claritude examines accessible lists using 2 technical checks, including definition lists have valid structure, lists contain valid list items. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified accessible lists.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with accessible lists.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve accessible lists, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant accessible lists target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about accessible lists. {unableReason}','Use ul, ol, and li for real lists and keep list children structurally valid. Do not convert ordinary paragraphs into lists solely for styling.','<ul>
