  ('audit-group.accessibility.touch-targets','Claritude examines touch targets using 1 technical check, including touch target size and spacing checked. This helps people using assistive technology, keyboards, touch screens, zoom, or smaller displays understand and operate the page.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified touch targets.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with touch targets.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve touch targets, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant touch targets target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about touch targets. {unableReason}','Increase the interactive area or spacing around each listed control. Preserve compact controls where an equivalent larger target is available.',null,'W3C WAI: Touch targets','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.cumulative-layout-shift','Claritude examines cumulative Layout Shift using 1 technical check, including cumulative Layout Shift measured. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','Mobile was {mobileValue} and desktop was {desktopValue}. The recommended threshold is {threshold}.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with cumulative Layout Shift.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve cumulative Layout Shift, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant cumulative Layout Shift target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about cumulative Layout Shift. {unableReason}','Reserve space for images, embeds, banners, and dynamic content. Use the listed shift contributors to fix the elements responsible for movement.',null,'web.dev: Cumulative Layout Shift','{"kind":"metric","fields":["mobileValue","desktopValue","threshold"],"unit":"score","threshold":"0.1 or less"}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":false,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.first-contentful-paint','Claritude examines first Contentful Paint using 1 technical check, including first Contentful Paint measured. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','Mobile was {mobileValue} and desktop was {desktopValue}. The recommended threshold is {threshold}.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with first Contentful Paint.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve first Contentful Paint, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant first Contentful Paint target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about first Contentful Paint. {unableReason}','Reduce render-blocking work, improve server response time, and prioritise the first visible content. Confirm the change on both tested viewports.',null,'web.dev: First Contentful Paint','{"kind":"metric","fields":["mobileValue","desktopValue","threshold"],"unit":"seconds_from_ms","threshold":"1.8 seconds or less"}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":false,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.largest-contentful-paint','Claritude examines largest Contentful Paint using 1 technical check, including largest Contentful Paint measured. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','Mobile was {mobileValue} and desktop was {desktopValue}. The recommended threshold is {threshold}.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with largest Contentful Paint.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve largest Contentful Paint, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant largest Contentful Paint target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about largest Contentful Paint. {unableReason}','Optimise the reported LCP element and its critical resource path. Prioritise the hero resource, reduce server delay, and avoid lazy-loading the LCP image.',null,'web.dev: Largest Contentful Paint','{"kind":"metric","fields":["mobileValue","desktopValue","threshold"],"unit":"seconds_from_ms","threshold":"2.5 seconds or less"}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":false,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.total-blocking-time','Claritude examines total Blocking Time using 1 technical check, including total Blocking Time measured. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','Mobile was {mobileValue} and desktop was {desktopValue}. The recommended threshold is {threshold}.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with total Blocking Time.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve total Blocking Time, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant total Blocking Time target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about total Blocking Time. {unableReason}','Split long JavaScript tasks, defer non-critical work, and reduce expensive third-party execution. Start with the largest blocking tasks shown by the audit.',null,'web.dev: Total Blocking Time','{"kind":"metric","fields":["mobileValue","desktopValue","threshold"],"unit":"milliseconds","threshold":"200 milliseconds or less"}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":false,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
