  ('audit-group.performance.resource-request-count','Claritude examines resource request count using 1 technical check, including total resource request count measured. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified resource request count.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with resource request count.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve resource request count, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant resource request count target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about resource request count. {unableReason}','Remove duplicate or unnecessary requests, combine only where caching and maintainability still benefit, and lazy-load resources that are not needed initially.',null,'web.dev: Resource request count','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.third-party-requests','Claritude examines third-party requests using 1 technical check, including third-party request count measured. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified third-party requests.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with third-party requests.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve third-party requests, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant third-party requests target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about third-party requests. {unableReason}','Remove unused third-party services and load necessary integrations only with appropriate consent and timing. Check the listed hosts before changing required business services.',null,'web.dev: Third-party requests','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.unused-css','Claritude examines unused CSS using 1 technical check, including unused CSS estimated. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified unused CSS.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with unused CSS.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve unused CSS, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant unused CSS target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about unused CSS. {unableReason}','Remove unused rules, split styles by page or component, and minify production CSS without removing styles needed after interaction.',null,'web.dev: Unused CSS','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.unused-javascript','Claritude examines unused JavaScript using 1 technical check, including unused JavaScript estimated. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified unused JavaScript.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with unused JavaScript.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve unused JavaScript, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant unused JavaScript target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about unused JavaScript. {unableReason}','Remove unused dependencies and code, split bundles by route or feature, and defer non-critical scripts while preserving required functionality.',null,'web.dev: Unused JavaScript','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.server-response-time','Claritude examines server response time using 1 technical check, including document response time measured. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified server response time.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with server response time.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve server response time, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant server response time target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about server response time. {unableReason}','Reduce application and database work, use suitable caching, and inspect hosting or upstream latency. Measure again from production after changes.',null,'web.dev: Server response time','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":false,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.failed-network-requests','Claritude examines failed network requests using 1 technical check, including failed network requests detected. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified failed network requests.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with failed network requests.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve failed network requests, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant failed network requests target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about failed network requests. {unableReason}','Correct or remove each failed request and confirm the destination returns the intended status, content type, and resource.',null,'web.dev: Failed network requests','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.repeated-resource-downloads','Claritude examines repeated resource downloads using 1 technical check, including repeated downloads of the same resource detected. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified repeated resource downloads.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with repeated resource downloads.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve repeated resource downloads, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant repeated resource downloads target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about repeated resource downloads. {unableReason}','Reuse a stable URL and cache policy for identical resources, and remove duplicate injections that cause the same asset to download more than once.',null,'web.dev: Repeated resource downloads','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.lcp-resource-optimisation','Claritude examines LCP resource optimisation using 2 technical checks, including largest Contentful Paint element identified, largest Contentful Paint resource discovery delay measured. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified LCP resource optimisation.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with LCP resource optimisation.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve LCP resource optimisation, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant LCP resource optimisation target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about LCP resource optimisation. {unableReason}','Make the LCP resource discoverable in the initial HTML, give it suitable priority, and do not lazy-load it. Optimise only the resource identified by the evidence.',null,'web.dev: LCP resource optimisation','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.performance.layout-shift-contributors','Claritude examines layout shift contributors using 1 technical check, including layout shift contributors identified. This affects how quickly and reliably visitors can see and interact with the page, especially on slower devices and connections.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified layout shift contributors.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with layout shift contributors.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve layout shift contributors, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant layout shift contributors target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about layout shift contributors. {unableReason}','Reserve stable dimensions and avoid inserting content above existing content. Use the reported elements to isolate the actual shift source.',null,'web.dev: Layout shift contributors','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.h1-headings','Claritude examines H1 headings using 3 technical checks, including H1 heading present, empty H1 headings detected, multiple H1 headings detected. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified H1 headings.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with H1 headings.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve H1 headings, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant H1 headings target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about H1 headings. {unableReason}','Provide one clear primary heading where it accurately describes the page, and ensure every H1 contains readable text. Multiple H1s can be valid when the document structure genuinely requires them.','<main>
  <h1>Website accessibility services</h1>
  …
</main>','W3C WAI: H1 headings','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.heading-structure','Claritude examines heading structure using 3 technical checks, including empty H2 to H6 headings detected, skipped heading levels detected, repeated heading text detected. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified heading structure.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with heading structure.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve heading structure, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant heading structure target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about heading structure. {unableReason}','Use headings to represent the content hierarchy, keep their text meaningful, and avoid skipping levels when that would make the structure confusing.',null,'W3C WAI: Heading structure','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.main-content-availability','Claritude examines main content availability using 5 technical checks, including main content contains extractable text, main content word count measured, text present in original HTML, and related evidence. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified main content availability.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with main content availability.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve main content availability, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant main content availability target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about main content availability. {unableReason}','Expose the primary page content as readable HTML after normal rendering and avoid gating public content behind unexpected login or bot challenges.',null,'Google Search Central: Main content availability','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.main-content-landmark','Claritude examines main content landmark using 2 technical checks, including main content landmark present, multiple main content landmarks detected. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified main content landmark.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with main content landmark.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve main content landmark, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant main content landmark target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about main content landmark. {unableReason}','Wrap the page''s primary content in one main element or equivalent landmark. Keep repeated navigation and footer content outside it.','<header>…</header>
<main id="main-content">…</main>
<footer>…</footer>','Google Search Central: Main content landmark','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.semantic-content-structures','Claritude examines semantic content structures using 2 technical checks, including lists use semantic list elements, data tables contain header cells. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified semantic content structures.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with semantic content structures.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve semantic content structures, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant semantic content structures target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about semantic content structures. {unableReason}','Use semantic lists and tables when the content calls for them. Keep the underlying HTML structure valid rather than relying on visual styling alone.',null,'Google Search Central: Semantic content structures','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.crawler-permissions','Claritude examines crawler permissions using 11 technical checks, including selected page allowed by Googlebot robots rules, selected page allowed by Bingbot robots rules, selected page allowed by OAI-SearchBot robots rules, and related evidence. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified crawler permissions.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with crawler permissions.','The audit recorded the site''s crawler permissions policy. Confirm that this state matches the publisher''s intent; it is not automatically a defect.','No relevant crawler permissions target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about crawler permissions. {unableReason}','Confirm each robots.txt and meta directive matches the site''s intended crawler policy. Blocking a crawler is valid when deliberate; correct only contradictory, malformed, or unintended rules.',null,'OpenAI: Crawler permissions','{"kind":"policy","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.indexing-directives','Claritude examines indexing directives using 5 technical checks, including meta robots directives detected, x-Robots-Tag directives detected, conflicting indexing directives detected, and related evidence. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified indexing directives.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with indexing directives.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve indexing directives, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant indexing directives target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about indexing directives. {unableReason}','Remove unintended noindex or conflicting directives from pages meant for search, or document the deliberate exclusion for pages that should remain unindexed.',null,'Google Search Central: Indexing directives','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.page-redirects','Claritude examines page redirects using 3 technical checks, including redirect chain detected, redirect loop detected, checked links containing redirect loops detected. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified page redirects.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with page redirects.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve page redirects, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant page redirects target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about page redirects. {unableReason}','Point the original URL directly to the final canonical destination, remove loops, and minimise unnecessary redirect hops.',null,'Google Search Central: Page redirects','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.redirecting-links','Claritude examines redirecting links using 2 technical checks, including redirecting internal links detected, redirecting external links detected. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified redirecting links.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with redirecting links.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve redirecting links, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant redirecting links target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about redirecting links. {unableReason}','Update affected internal links to their final destination. Keep deliberate external redirects only when the destination is trustworthy and stable.',null,'Google Search Central: Redirecting links','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.robots-txt','Claritude examines robots.txt using 4 technical checks, including robots.txt file reachable, robots.txt contains readable text, robots.txt parsing errors detected, and related evidence. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified robots.txt.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with robots.txt.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve robots.txt, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant robots.txt target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about robots.txt. {unableReason}','Serve a readable robots.txt at the site root, keep directives syntactically valid, and ensure listed sitemap URLs are correct.','User-agent: *
Allow: /

Sitemap: https://example.com/sitemap.xml','Google Search Central: Robots.txt','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.xml-sitemap','Claritude examines XML sitemap using 5 technical checks, including conventional sitemap locations checked, referenced XML sitemap reachable, referenced sitemap XML valid, and related evidence. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified XML sitemap.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with XML sitemap.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve XML sitemap, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant XML sitemap target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about XML sitemap. {unableReason}','Serve valid sitemap XML, use absolute canonical URLs, keep entries on the intended host, and remove broken or redirected sitemap references.','<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url><loc>https://example.com/</loc></url>
</urlset>','Google Search Central: XML sitemap','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.contact-link-formats','Claritude examines contact link formats using 2 technical checks, including telephone link formats checked, email link formats checked. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified contact link formats.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with contact link formats.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve contact link formats, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant contact link formats target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about contact link formats. {unableReason}','Correct affected mailto and tel destinations so they contain valid, usable addresses or telephone numbers.','<a href="mailto:hello@example.com">Email us</a>
<a href="tel:+442079460000">Call us</a>','Google Search Central: Contact link formats','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.download-links','Claritude examines download links using 1 technical check, including download links identified. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified download links.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with download links.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve download links, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant download links target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about download links. {unableReason}','Confirm each download link intentionally identifies a downloadable resource and that the destination, filename, and format are clear to users.',null,'Google Search Central: Download links','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.https-page-links-to-http-destinations','Claritude examines HTTPS page links to HTTP destinations using 1 technical check, including HTTPS page links to HTTP destinations. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified HTTPS page links to HTTP destinations.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with HTTPS page links to HTTP destinations.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve HTTPS page links to HTTP destinations, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant HTTPS page links to HTTP destinations target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about HTTPS page links to HTTP destinations. {unableReason}','Update each listed HTTP destination to HTTPS where the destination supports it. Do not rewrite third-party URLs that have no valid HTTPS endpoint.',null,'Google Search Central: HTTPS page links to HTTP destinations','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.javascript-link-destinations','Claritude examines javaScript link destinations using 1 technical check, including javaScript link destinations detected. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified javaScript link destinations.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with javaScript link destinations.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve javaScript link destinations, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant javaScript link destinations target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about javaScript link destinations. {unableReason}','Replace javascript: URLs with real links or buttons and attach behaviour with JavaScript event handlers.','<button type="button" id="open-dialog">Open details</button>','Google Search Central: JavaScript link destinations','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.link-destination-health','Claritude examines link destination health using 10 technical checks, including checked links returning HTTP 404 detected, checked links returning HTTP 410 detected, checked links returning server errors detected, and related evidence. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified link destination health.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with link destination health.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve link destination health, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant link destination health target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about link destination health. {unableReason}','Correct, replace, or remove each affected destination according to its recorded DNS, TLS, timeout, redirect, or HTTP failure.',null,'Google Search Central: Link destination health','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.seo.link-inventory','Claritude examines link inventory using 3 technical checks, including internal links identified, external links identified, checked and unchecked link totals recorded. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified link inventory.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with link inventory.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve link inventory, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant link inventory target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about link inventory. {unableReason}','Use the inventory to confirm important pages are linked and unnecessary destinations are removed. Counts alone do not require a change.',null,'Google Search Central: Link inventory','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
