  ('audit-group.seo.meta-description','Claritude examines meta description using 4 technical checks, including meta description present, meta description not empty, multiple meta descriptions detected, and related evidence. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified meta description.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with meta description.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve meta description, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant meta description target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about meta description. {unableReason}','Provide one useful description for pages intended for search. Keep it specific to the page and remove conflicting duplicate declarations.','<meta name="description" content="Independent accessibility audits and practical remediation support.">','Google Search Central: Meta description','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
