  ('audit-group.seo.apple-touch-icon','Claritude examines apple touch icon using 2 technical checks, including apple touch icon declared, declared Apple touch icon reachable. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified apple touch icon.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with apple touch icon.','The audit found an optional or suboptimal apple touch icon opportunity. This is not a confirmed technical failure.','No relevant apple touch icon target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about apple touch icon. {unableReason}','Declare a reachable icon in a suitable format and size. This is an enhancement, so omit it rather than publishing a broken or misleading asset.','<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">','Google Search Central: Apple touch icon','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
