  ('audit-group.seo.product-structured-data','Claritude examines product structured data using 2 technical checks, including declared product price formats valid, declared product currency codes valid. Clear page structure and dependable crawl signals help search engines understand the page and help visitors recognise useful results.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified product structured data.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with product structured data.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve product structured data, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant product structured data target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about product structured data. {unableReason}','Use Product data only for genuine products and provide valid numeric price and ISO currency values that match the visible offer.','{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Product","name":"Example product","offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"29.00","priceCurrency":"GBP"}}','Google Search Central: Product structured data','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
