  ('audit-group.security.content-security-policy','Claritude examines content Security Policy using 5 technical checks, including content-Security-Policy header present, content-Security-Policy is report-only, content-Security-Policy contains unsafe-inline allowances, and related evidence. A correct implementation reduces avoidable browser and transport risk without claiming to replace a full security assessment.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified content Security Policy.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with content Security Policy.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve content Security Policy, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant content Security Policy target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about content Security Policy. {unableReason}','Deploy an enforced Content-Security-Policy, remove unnecessary unsafe-inline and unsafe-eval allowances, and test required third-party resources before tightening directives.','Content-Security-Policy: default-src ''self''; script-src ''self''; object-src ''none''; base-uri ''self''; frame-ancestors ''self''','OWASP: Content Security Policy','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
  ('audit-group.security.cookie-security','Claritude examines cookie security using 4 technical checks, including observed cookies have Secure attributes, observed cookies have HttpOnly attributes, observed cookies have SameSite attributes, and related evidence. A correct implementation reduces avoidable browser and transport risk without claiming to replace a full security assessment.','All {checkedCount} applicable technical checks verified cookie security.','{failedCount} of {checkedCount} technical checks found a problem with cookie security.','The evidence indicates an opportunity to improve cookie security, but it does not justify treating it as a confirmed failure.','No relevant cookie security target was present on this page, so the group did not apply.','Claritude could not reach a reliable conclusion about cookie security. {unableReason}','Add Secure, HttpOnly, and an appropriate SameSite value to each sensitive cookie. Do not add HttpOnly to cookies that client-side code genuinely must read.','Set-Cookie: session=…; Path=/; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax','MDN: Cookie security','{"kind":"summary","fields":["checkedCount","passedCount","failedCount","advisoryCount","unableCount","status","url","value"]}'::jsonb,'{"enabled":true,"initialLimit":10,"fields":["html","locator","url","resourceType","viewport","status","value","source"]}'::jsonb,2),
